docs {
  # Admin List Users
  
  Admin lists and searches users.
  Each user item now includes the user's wallet balance so the admin users table can show balance beside the credit/debit actions.
  
  ## Endpoint
  
  `GET /api/v1/admin/users`
  
  ## Query Params
  
  `search`
  Search first name, last name, username, email, or phone.
  
  `role`
  Optional: `user`, `vendor`, `admin`.
  
  `status`
  Optional: `active` or `inactive`.
  
  `authTier`
  Optional: `tier_1`, `tier_2`, or `tier_3`.
  
  `page`, `limit`
  Pagination.

  ## Response Notes

  Each `users[]` item includes:

  ```json
  {
    "id": "user_id",
    "firstName": "Ada",
    "lastName": "Lovelace",
    "email": "ada@example.com",
    "wallet": {
      "currency": "NGN",
      "mainBalance": 2500,
      "referralBalance": 300,
      "balances": {
        "main": 2500,
        "referral": 300
      },
      "rawBalances": {
        "main": 250000,
        "referral": 30000
      }
    }
  }
  ```

  Use `wallet.mainBalance` for the main wallet balance in the users table. Use `wallet.referralBalance` if the admin can also credit/debit referral balance.
}
